  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Wrist_items\" title=\"Category:Wrist items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Wrist.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bracelet_of_Madness\">Bracelet of Madness</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #FFBBBB solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#FFBBBB;--bg-color-1-dark:#573F3F;--bg-color-2:#FFE4E1;--bg-color-2-dark:#3D2C2A;--header-color:#FFBBBB;--header-color-dark:#573F3F;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\">20\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Disc_Generic_Purple.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Disc_Generic_Purple.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Jewelry / Bracers\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Wrist\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">110\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a>:</b> Items made of <b>gem</b> are generally extremely durable and have a very high <a href=\"/page/Hardness\" title=\"Hardness\">hardness</a>. Most commonly used to make trinkets and docents.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0010020000</span>10,020<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Hound_of_Xoriat\" title=\"Hound of Xoriat\">Hound of Xoriat</a></b>, Side chest (Hard/Elite)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +48</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +48</a>:</b> Passive: +48 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to each <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Spell Lore III</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Spell Lore III</a>:</b> Passive: All of your spells gain a 3% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Evocation Focus II</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Evocation Focus II</a>:</b> +2 Equipment bonus to the DC of Evocation spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Feeds_Off_Madness\" title=\"Feeds Off Madness\">Feeds Off Madness</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Feeds_Off_Madness\" title=\"Feeds Off Madness\">Feeds Off Madness</a>:</b> This item greedily feeds off the aura of madness related to certain <a href=\"/page/Xoriat\" title=\"Xoriat\">Xoriat</a> effects. The more of these its wearer is affected by, the stronger this item will become.</span></span>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_penetration\" title=\"Spell penetration\"> Spell Penetration II</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_penetration\" title=\"Spell penetration\"> Spell Penetration II</a>:</b> Passive: +2 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Spell Penetration checks.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +52</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +52</a>:</b> Passive: +52 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to each <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Bracelet_of_Madness.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Bracelet_of_Madness.png/420px-Bracelet_of_Madness.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"391\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Bracelet_of_Madness.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This bracelet enhances your spellcasting power, but it seems to whisper to you, urging you to seek out other items touched by Xoriat. Wear it with other items affected by the Plane of Madness to gain further power.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Feeds_Off_Madness\" title=\"Feeds Off Madness\">Feeds Off Madness</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Feeds_Off_Madness\" title=\"Feeds Off Madness\">Feeds Off Madness</a>:</b> This item greedily feeds off the aura of madness related to certain <a href=\"/page/Xoriat\" title=\"Xoriat\">Xoriat</a> effects. The more of these its wearer is affected by, the stronger this item will become.</span></span> adds these effects if certain items are equipped when the Bracelet of Madness is equipped. The effects remain active if the other items are un-equipped (probably a bug):\n<ul><li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_penetration\" title=\"Spell penetration\"> Spell Penetration II</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_penetration\" title=\"Spell penetration\"> Spell Penetration II</a>:</b> Passive: +2 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Spell Penetration checks.</span></span> if <a href=\"/page/Trace_of_Madness\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trace of Madness\">Trace of Madness</a> upgraded armor is equipped first</li>\n<li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +52</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +52</a>:</b> Passive: +52 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to each <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span> if <a href=\"/page/Polycurse_Dagger\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Polycurse Dagger\">Polycurse Dagger</a>, <a href=\"/page/Glorious_Obscenity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Glorious Obscenity\">Glorious Obscenity</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Trace_of_Madness\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trace of Madness\">Trace of Madness</a> upgraded armor is equipped first and <a href=\"/page/Sustaining_Symbiont\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sustaining Symbiont\">Sustaining Symbiont</a> is not equipped first. <a href=\"/page/Sustaining_Symbiont\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sustaining Symbiont\">Sustaining Symbiont</a> can be equipped after the Bracelet of Madness and this effect will remain</li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817034855\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.089 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.131 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5433/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34960/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11707/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/500000